@startuml ch6-class-core-models
' F6.1a Iteration 1 core capture models, as at tag v0.2.0-mid2 (13 Oct 2026).
' Verified against: git show v0.2.0-mid2:src/aegis/core/models.py
!include _aegis_style.iuml
!include _aegis_class.iuml

  class CameraIntrinsics <<capture>> {
    +fx, fy, cx, cy: float
  }
  class Frame <<capture>> {
    +frame_id: int
    +timestamp: float
    +path: str
    +width, height: int
  }
  class Pose <<capture>> {
    +frame_id: int
    +timestamp: float
    +matrix: 4×4 tuple
    +convention = "T_world_camera"
    +source: str
  }
  class Detection2D <<capture>> {
    +frame_id, track_id: int
    +label: str
    +confidence: float
    +bbox: tuple[4 × float]
    +mask: Any
    +is_hand: bool
    +contact_target_track_id: int | None
  }
  class BoundingBox3D <<capture>> {
    +frame_id, track_id: int
    +label: str
    +confidence: float
    +center, size: tuple[3 × float]
    +bbox_2d: tuple[4 × float]
    +spatial_state: str
    +container_relation: str | None
    +rotation: tuple[4 × float] | None
    +yaw: float | None
    +is_hand, is_in_hand: bool
    +carrier: str | None
    +held_by_hand_track_id: int | None
  }

CameraIntrinsics -[hidden]right- Frame
Frame -[hidden]right- Pose
CameraIntrinsics -[hidden]down- Detection2D
Detection2D ..right..> BoundingBox3D : «lifted to»

legend bottom right
  |<#DCE9F7> | aegis.core.models (M-A) |
endlegend
@enduml
